1
00:00:00,685 --> 00:00:02,685
(Sheldon:)Leonard,

2
00:00:02,688 --> 00:00:04,818
(Sheldon:)they have a
sculpture gallery.

3
00:00:09,126 --> 00:00:11,296
(Security Guard:)All right, I talked
to my supervisor,

4
00:00:11,296 --> 00:00:12,626
(Security Guard:)and we're gonna let you go
with a warning.

5
00:00:12,631 --> 00:00:14,361
(sighs in relief)
But if you ever
come back,

6
00:00:14,366 --> 00:00:15,966
(Security Guard:)we will call the police
and press charges.

7
00:00:15,968 --> 00:00:16,968
(Leonard:)We understand.

8
00:00:16,969 --> 00:00:17,969
(Leonard:)Thank you so much.

9
00:00:17,970 --> 00:00:19,600
(Nerdy Guy:)Uh, what about me?

10
00:00:19,604 --> 00:00:20,974
(Security Guard:)No, you're not going
anywhere, kissy face.

11
00:00:20,973 --> 00:00:22,643
(Security Guard:)Let's go.

12
00:00:22,641 --> 00:00:25,641
(Security Guard:)I have to take your picture
to post at the guard gate.

13
00:00:25,644 --> 00:00:26,644
(Sheldon:)Uh, one question

14
00:00:26,645 --> 00:00:28,215
(Sheldon:)about that picture.

15
00:00:28,213 --> 00:00:29,813
(Sheldon:)Can it be with
George Lucas?

16
00:00:31,649 --> 00:00:33,619
(imitating Yoda):
Ooh, grumpy you are.

17
00:00:38,723 --> 00:00:41,723
(Howard:)Okay, this is the match
that decides it all.

18
00:00:41,727 --> 00:00:43,057
(Howard:)First to 11 wins.

19
00:00:43,061 --> 00:00:45,891
(Howard:)Serve switches
every five points.

20
00:00:45,897 --> 00:00:47,397
(Howard:)And just so you know,
when this started,

21
00:00:47,399 --> 00:00:50,069
(Howard:)I was going to put the TARDIS in
a discreet corner of the house,

22
00:00:50,068 --> 00:00:51,738
(Howard:)but I've since turned
mean, and now it's going

23
00:00:51,737 --> 00:00:53,237
(Howard:)right in the middle
of the living room

24
00:00:53,238 --> 00:00:54,908
(Howard:)on a rotating platform with
a sign that says "suck it."

25
00:00:54,906 --> 00:00:55,976
(Howard:)Game on.

26
00:00:58,476 --> 00:00:59,806
(Bernadette:)Except...

27
00:00:59,811 --> 00:01:02,141
(Bernadette:)Raj is gonna win.

